s global timer name."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"daemonName"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The set of rooms the actor teleports within."}]}],"name":"rooms"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Per-Turn chance of a move, while in the set.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"percent"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Extra gate checked first — a false gate is a quiet, draw-free turn.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"gate"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Line printed when the player watches the actor arrive."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"arrival"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Line printed when the player watches the actor leave."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"departure"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The roaming daemon, for the host’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"while:"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate evaluated "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"first","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", before the position guard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and before any draw, exactly as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MeleeCombat.aggression(of:…)"},{"type":"text","text":"’s is — so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a roamer whose wandering is scoped (the thief holds still while you are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"standing in his lair) burns no randomness on the turns his gate is shut,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeping every seeded draw sequence intact. The default gate is always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open, so a caller that does not pass one behaves exactly as before."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that, with "},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", moves "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to a random"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"other"}]},{"type":"text","text":" room in "},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — a teleport within the set, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the actor is outside "},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — including after "},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but the host should still "},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the actor’s death."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Moving an actor","anchor":"Moving-an-actor","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)"],"generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/roams(_:daemonname:rooms:chanceperturn:while:arrival:departure:)"]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns no entities and no state — position ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the actor’s placement —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own "},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","title":"ActorBehaviors","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Location":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Location","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/location","abstract":[{"text":"A place in the world.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Location","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Location"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Actor":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","abstract":[{"text":"A character in the world — a troll, a thief, a parrot.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Actor","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/actor","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrival","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"text":" to park the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"text":" to resume.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"text":"), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrival on turn one.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:daemonname:rooms:while:arrivals:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"follows","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"while","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"title":"TimedEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/timedevent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A named timed event, declared in a game or bundle "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block: a fuse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(fires once, N turns after it is started) or a daemon (runs at the end of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every turn while active). The body is registered at bootstrap and never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialized; only the schedule — name → turns remaining, or the active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flag — lives in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldState"},{"type":"text","text":", so it saves and restores like any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state and a restore re-binds it to the declared body by name."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"role":"collection","title":"GnustoActors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"other"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a teleport within the set, with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the actor is outside ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the actor’s death.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","url":"\/documentation\/g